  misc={"vpa_early": ("The Vernacular Press Act was passed before the revolt of 1857.", "The Vernacular Press Act was passed in 1878, after the revolt of 1857 changed the attitude to freedom of the press, as vernacular newspapers became assertively nationalist.")},
